## 3. scrutinize review (the Step's check) — verdict: fix-then-ship; fixes applied
Findings and dispositions:
  F1 (major) Bash makes "read-only" attestation-gapped host-side
      -> each definition now mandates a verbatim `git status --short` clean-tree
         attestation; orchestrator independently re-checks before recording a PASS.
  F2 (major) validation-auditor contained an invented ">=20% interim sample" constant
      -> replaced: sample size comes from the invoking step; if unspecified, the
         auditor states size + RNG seed explicitly. No silent constants.
  F3 (minor) stats-auditor "implement yourself" could induce hand-rolled estimators
      -> clarified: independence = no /src code; pinned-env scipy/numpy routines
         preferred; cite routine + parameters; hand-implement only gaps.
  F4 (minor) scope extensions unlabeled (RS baseline check; perf cross-check)
      -> labeled inline as extensions with their roadmap sources (§6.3/1.4.1; 0.2.3).
  F5 (minor) /results/audit/ layout extension introduced silently
      -> recorded here as a delegated choice (see §2 above).

